195
00:10:39,866 --> 00:10:42,966
I don't suggest using battery buffers here

196
00:10:42,966 --> 00:10:44,800
but theoretically you could

197
00:10:45,366 --> 00:10:52,700
but you still have the issue that you must ensure that the multiblock gets the one hundred and twenty EU per tick

198
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,166
